label m_yuri_1:
    [   0] m 1a "Great job, [player]!"
    [   1] m "I was going 'Ooh' in my head while reading it."
    [   2] m 1j "It's really metaphorical!"
    [   3] m 1a "I'm not sure why, but I didn't expect you to go for something so deep."
    [   4] m 3b "I guess I underestimated you!"
    [   5] mc "It's easiest for me to keep everyone's expectations low."
    [   6] mc "That way, it always counts when I put in some effort."
    [   7] m 5a "Ahaha! That's not very fair!"
    [   8] m "Well, I guess it worked, anyway."
    [   9] m 2a "You know that Yuri likes this kind of writing, right?"
    [  10] m "Writing that's full of imagery and symbolism."
    [  11] m 2d "Unlike Sayori, who likes using simple and direct words to describe happiness and sadness..."
    [  12] m "Yuri likes it when readers are left to derive their own meaning out of it."
    [  13] m 4d "It's very challenging to write like that effectively."
    [  14] m "Both allowing people to get something out of it just by feel..."
    [  15] m "Or letting them deeply analyze all of the nuances."
    [  16] m "It can take years of practice, which I'm assuming Yuri has at this point."
    [  17] m 1e "I never really asked, though..."
    [  18] mc "I'm sure I'm nowhere near her level yet."
    [  19] m 2b "Don't worry so much about that!"
    [  20] m "You do your own thing."
    [  21] m "Just keep exploring, and learn by trying new things!"
    [  22] return
